{
    "patchVersionCode":  62,
    "patchVersionName":  "v229-zolano-quick-visible-only",
    "notes":  [
                  "Fixes Zolano quick model grid so old unapproved models like 2631, 2623, HC 1026, HC 81032, HC 8502, 2629, 2630, 2627, and 2195 do not show.",
                  "Keeps v228 restored preview/photo behavior and the 3 line-cutout sample thumbnails.",
                  "Keeps downloaded Zolano armchair assets available for later approved line/cutout work."
              ],
